  "title": "Persisted AEF receipt (aef-receipt/1 legacy, aef-receipt/1.1)",
  "description": "Server-issued, immutable, hash-anchored receipt stored by the persistent AEF (IV-AEF-HARDENING-01). aef-receipt/1 receipts are legacy and never rewritten; aef-receipt/1.1 adds receipt_kind and the RECONCILIATION kind, an append-only complementary record for an UNKNOWN_OUTCOME operation. No payload, prompt, credential or free text. Distinct from the wire ExecutionReceipt v1 (execution-receipt.v1.schema.json), which is unchanged.",
